column11:
One way mirror,
Shadows of the past;
Distorted presence.

Committing to future,
By the flames of your past;
Gentle upheaval.

Making step and pushing chairs,
Hanging ties, and simply falling;
Currents down from far ago

Scapes of layers;
Ever slipping verity
Of letting go

Amongst the remnants of times,
Gone and coming… exploding;
Summary notes.
